  "divergences": [
    "CPU builds dense-free CSR and CSC for the same call; MPS 2.14.1 cannot construct sparse compressed tensors (new_compressed_tensor has no MPS kernel), so layout=sparse_csr/sparse_csc raises NotImplementedError instead of returning a COO tensor under another layout name",
    "when one diagonal's count is negative but the total is not, the CPU kernel allocates sum(counts) entries and writes the negative block out of bounds; the MPS overlay rejects that input, so the two differ only on an input whose CPU result is undefined"
  ],
